LitricOS nano profile, booted in QEMU with a VGA display and an emulated
keyboard and mouse, 2026-08-29. Input was driven through the QEMU monitor,
so the path exercised is the real one: evdev -> litric-input -> shortcuts ->
litric-wm -> compositor. Screenshots beside this file.

--- input discovery -------------------------------------------------
input.device=/dev/input/event1
input.device=/dev/input/event2
input.device=/dev/input/event4
input.found=5
input.keyboard=true
input.opened=3
input.pointer=true

